<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">TABLE I</span>: </span><span id="S4.T1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Quantitative comparison of our method against ANTFields <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib27" title="" class="ltx_ref">27</a>]</cite>, and TDM <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib9" title="" class="ltx_ref">9</a>]</cite>. SR refers to the motion planning success rate after the environment is fully explored. FT is the training time per frame, and MT is the total mapping time. </span></figcaption>
</figure>
